WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Use normal document flow for the initial layout.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Allow text and cards to wrap naturally.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Avoid a fixed page width that exceeds the viewport.

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Exercise: inspect the page at 320 CSS pixels.
